# Keep the long-lived server entrypoint out of Vercel deployments.
# Vercel detects src/server.ts as the "root entrypoint" and deploys it as the
# catch-all "index" function, which (a) ignores api/agent.ts and its
# includeFiles (so the circuits are missing at runtime -> INVALID_TASK on
# every proof), and (b) breaks the /agent rewrite. Excluding it forces
# Vercel to deploy api/agent.ts as the serverless function with the
# circuits bundled. src/server.ts is still in the repo for `npm start`
# (long-lived hosting) and is only hidden from Vercel.
src/server.ts
